Physical Floorplan Layout & Macro Placement
 * Die Dimensions: 2.5\text{ mm} \times 2.5\text{ mm} (7nm FinFET Technology Node).
 * Macro Matrix Coordinate Mapping:
   * SRAM Macro Bank A (0x000 - 0x7FF): Coordinates (X: 0.20\text{ mm}, Y: 0.20\text{ mm}) to (X: 1.10\text{ mm}, Y: 1.20\text{ mm}).
   * SRAM Macro Bank B (0x800 - 0xFFF): Coordinates (X: 1.30\text{ mm}, Y: 0.20\text{ mm}) to (X: 2.20\text{ mm}, Y: 1.20\text{ mm}).
   * Plonk/Halo2 Cryptographic Coprocessor Core: Coordinates (X: 0.20\text{ mm}, Y: 1.40\text{ mm}) to (X: 1.40\text{ mm}, Y: 2.30\text{ mm}).
   * AXI4-Stream Ingress & Scheduler Logic: Coordinates (X: 1.50\text{ mm}, Y: 1.40\text{ mm}) to (X: 2.30\text{ mm}, Y: 2.30\text{ mm}).
 * Thermal Via Grid Integration: 1000W DBSS-78 sintered copper micro-channel vapor chamber thermal interface directly overlying the crypto core and SRAM banks, maintaining junction temperatures below 75^\circ\text{C}.
